{"code":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108130","section":"Left Cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=xZpsdad6jglXGVL6UNG5Pg&viewpoint=33.64771039567766%2C133.77834290025464&heading=82.26809118063264&pitch=-5.1633006188504424","text":"Can be found in: - Kochi - Mie","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108130","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-f1d38e7aef945aeb13a9.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108141","section":"Thin left cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=hQzLAVfq8NNu6zImJqXoig&viewpoint=32.951982367436344%2C131.1086287100992&heading=193.740180359126&pitch=-17.574413508833317","text":"Can be found in: - Ishikawa - Kumamoto","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108141","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-a91d09f811a16dbbc2a4.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108129","section":"Inversed left cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=KkMH-p7UlhnROdV_XvaNFg&viewpoint=40.77957566873912%2C140.2075851979883&heading=304.19936921467973&pitch=-10.208586659294753","text":"Can be found in: - Aomori","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108129","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-021aa9b6cfff2f264bac.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108136","section":"Right cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=P3cNIuxLdN0Yxeb4dIXemw&viewpoint=34.62561315884867%2C133.58669380839797&heading=248.70000480441217&pitch=-23.27391836410007","text":"Can be found in: - Okayama - Hyogo - Kyoto - Miyagi","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108136","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-6143330fb5c560e6a1f4.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108139","section":"Small right cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=gr79lCuUajhCnpfDxiAhcA&viewpoint=34.175169423806324%2C134.61620833235972&heading=111.30016856638468&pitch=-11.074160135590404","text":"Can be found in: - Hiroshima - Tokushima It's pretty difficult to tell it apart from the default version. When you see it exactly in front or behind yourself, diamond should be narrower and a bit more thin. But if it appears from the side, the task becomes way harder. Also you should be careful if you stay on some tight single-lane road, because it makes the comparsion of sizes kind of unclear.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108139","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-1860c6e287d455514d09.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108131","section":"Left double cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=KuuY-9K3EhRiUN9lfTSAsg&viewpoint=37.04695160033118%2C137.87892982052472&heading=154.8908847850143&pitch=-16.58652809228137","text":"Can be found in: - Niigata - Tochigi - Ibaraki - Saitama - Shiga - Okinawa In Niigata thin version probably is more common than the default.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108131","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-47945e3a6cadbab37e7b.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108137","section":"Right double cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=r_8lEe5Pzfxn8Rt6znc-4g&viewpoint=36.93661031124536%2C137.49928780667068&heading=350.84788581165293&pitch=-15.393371087506523","text":"Can be found in: - Toyama - Oita","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108137","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-ae14bbc45e18fc1d0d32.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108142","section":"Thin left double cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Llw4z-oO7PE2HmXqhzn_9w&viewpoint=37.7440601274629%2C139.17570452820655&heading=208.59487191584518&pitch=-26.269301465665727","text":"Can be found in: - Niigata - Ibaraki In Niigata thin version probably is more common than the default.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108142","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-d581ecb0046883bee87a.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108133","section":"Left propeller","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=yRrVhIrcPDjthx_5awwlMA&viewpoint=36.138015062905005%2C137.24650368125484&heading=71.29133132531854&pitch=-9.253154853058234","text":"Can be found in: - Gunma - Chiba - Gifu.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108133","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-ca6a65896c3daa3e5b73.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108138","section":"Right propeller","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=fAaAP1-Mlwz3rsJAOGhvyg&viewpoint=33.989664483871906%2C135.79228584090393&heading=138.05922439320312&pitch=-21.581316744420704","text":"Can be found in: - Nara - Wakyama","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108138","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-c02cc7d33872bb584278.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108140","section":"Small right propeller","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=3R3wm8lcBf_NQkdfhDowUg&viewpoint=34.48859914888954%2C135.72625695440263&heading=268.65247599943814&pitch=-6.801316704212795","text":"Can be found in: - Nara It's pretty difficult to tell it apart from the default version. When you see it exactly in front or behind yourself, diamond should be narrower and a bit more thin. But if it appears from the side, the task becomes way harder. Also you should be careful if you stay on some tight single-lane road, because it's make the comparsion of sizes kind of unclear. Seems like it's still a new type of road markings, so there is no much of them. I didn't manage to find more than 3.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108140","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-b36789279b17215e3749.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108144","section":"Thin left propeller","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=eM8ulPuQHT24NJNFbZ_Z9g&viewpoint=35.78007428794341%2C138.42596284068568&heading=9.811561415889525&pitch=-10.70068244656312","text":"Can be found in: - Yamanashi - Nagano","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108144","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-45080dedba085275f23e.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108134","section":"Middle cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=JgwkpS0xDTxvwDlwc78P9w&viewpoint=35.494741954627216%2C133.6908916179909&heading=271.4672123366633&pitch=-7.688149957888115","text":"Can be found in: - Shimane - Tottori - Saga","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108134","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-add6310dedfc22a8aced.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108145","section":"Thin middle cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=3sRPW_eiEeaSqsia7YEXKg&viewpoint=33.19656496516107%2C130.01856103495774&heading=320.77800726115476&pitch=-14.953228905801126","text":"Can be found in: - Saga","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108145","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-c3f106764aff97717f8c.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108135","section":"Regular","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=NZ7xipFO0FDylw_W8ZiJFg&viewpoint=34.58249858325487%2C135.47970464203974&heading=300.07448522669523&pitch=-7.113753546366212","text":"In general, this diamonds can be found in every prefecture, but according to 5UP3RB doc most likely they would appear in the following regions: - Hokkaido - Aomori - Akita - Iwate - Fukushima - Tokio - Kanagawa - Fukui - Aichi - Osaka - Ehime - Fukuoka - Nagasaki - Miyazaki - Kagoshima I tried to include them all but seems like the further north you go, the less diamonds you see. So i didn't manage to find one in Yamagata and Aomori.","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108135","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-7b103c85ffe4f495c811.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108146","section":"Thin regular","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=i3peOnE4q-HRRI3HJvJ-Dg&viewpoint=35.12561538212705%2C136.7788043390227&heading=148.90968692074475&pitch=-16.24349010576475","text":"Can be found in: - Nagano - Aichi - Yamaguchi - Kagoshima","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108146","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-47f7c714d066ff68d7dd.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108132","section":"Left one side cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=HT_N0JxojXI-svoltnWYdA&viewpoint=34.28134629939344%2C134.00003597987916&heading=205.0220214464026&pitch=-14.671326820814755","text":"Can be found in: - Kagawa","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108132","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-90bad0475ef7dd34c692.avif"},{"id":"geocoach-japanese-diamonds-108143","section":"Thin left one side cut","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=sCTPbx_kQP0BTwZi8XIsMQ&viewpoint=34.63849146133443%2C138.12825523448362&heading=93.17136011598018&pitch=-3.855854557138329","text":"Can be found in: - Shizuoka","countryCodes":["JP"],"sourceTagId":"108143","image":"meta-courses/images/geocoach-9c6830173854f1c57e82.avif"}]}